<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz-W up 57 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz-W up 57 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and engineering company Elektromontaz Warszawa SA started bourse trade on the parallel market at 5.5 zlotys, 57 percent above issue price.</p>
<p>Elektromontaz Warszawa's November 1,750,000-share-initial public offering, priced at 3.5 zlotys per share, was slightly undersubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
